---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Josh Oney | Developer Portfolio">
	<section class="hero">
		<h1>Quality Engineer & <span class="highlight">Systems Developer</span></h1>
		
		<div class="hero-body">
			<p class="bio-text">
				Welcome to my personal portfolio. With over 15 years of experience as a Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET), I specialize in architecting scalable automation frameworks, driving continuous integration, and engineering robust quality solutions from the ground up.
			</p>
			<p class="bio-text">
				This space serves as a live playground for my latest projects—blending my passion for deep technical problem-solving with modern web development.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="directory-section">
			<h2>DIRECTORY OVERVIEW</h2>
			<div class="directory-list">
				<div class="dir-item c-red">
					<strong>Navigation</strong> &mdash; You are here. The root of the system providing an overview of my current projects and a directory of available modules.
				</div>
				<div class="dir-item c-amber">
					<strong>Local LLM Evals</strong> &mdash; A live telemetry dashboard built to parse and visualize complex AI evaluation data. View real-time pass/fail rates, reasoning logs, and interactive AI-generated artifacts.
				</div>
				<div class="dir-item c-blue">
					<strong>evaluerBench</strong> &mdash; Detailed architectural notes and reasoning behind the evaluerBench project, focusing on how I track and compare Local LLM inferences.
				</div>
				<div class="dir-item c-tan">
					<strong>&lt; THIS_SITE /&gt;</strong> &mdash; Documentation on the creation of this portfolio site, discussing the Star Trek LCARS aesthetic, responsive CSS techniques, and why I chose Astro.
				</div>
				<div class="dir-item c-purple">
					<strong>Games (Coming Soon)</strong> &mdash; A future module for interactive web-based games and experiments.
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding: 20px 0 60px 0;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: 3.2rem;
		line-height: 1.15;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.5px;
	}

	.highlight {
		color: var(--lcars-amber);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-weight: normal;
	}

	.hero-body {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 15px;
		margin-bottom: 50px;
	}

	.bio-text {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.directory-section h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 2.2rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		letter-spacing: -0.5px;
	}

	.directory-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 6px;
	}

	.dir-item {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
	}
	
	.dir-item strong {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.dir-item.c-red { color: var(--lcars-red); }
	.dir-item.c-amber { color: var(--lcars-amber); }
	.dir-item.c-blue { color: var(--lcars-blue); }
	.dir-item.c-tan { color: var(--lcars-tan); }
	.dir-item.c-purple { color: var(--lcars-purple); }

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.hero h1 {
			font-size: 2.4rem;
		}
	}
</style>